  %% Business relationships
  Citizen -->|raises| Complaint
  Complaint -->|belongs to| ComplaintType
  ComplaintType -->|owned by| Department
  ComplaintType -->|defines| SLA
  Complaint -->|has| Status
  Complaint -->|assigned via| Assignment
