  Employee -->|works in| Department
  Employee -->|covers| Jurisdiction
  Complaint -->|located in| Jurisdiction
  Escalation -->|moves assignment to reportingTo of| Employee
  SLA -->|drives| Escalation
  Complaint -->|triggers| Notification
  Citizen -->|gives| Rating
  Admin -->|creates| Workspace

